Quality: Gates

Purpose:
  Defines static quality gates for all supported technology stacks.

StaticQualityGates:
  Go:
    - gofmt
    - go vet
    - staticcheck
    - tests
  TypeScript:
    - eslint
    - tsc
    - tests
  Flutter:
    - dart analyze
    - flutter test
  React Native:
    - eslint
    - tsc
    - jest
  PHP:
    - phpcs
    - psalm
    - tests
  Java:
    - checkstyle
    - spotbugs
    - tests
  Python:
    - black
    - flake8
    - mypy
    - tests

QualityGate:
  Format:
    QUALITY-GATE-<ID>

    Condition:
      No lint errors

    Evidence:
      linter report

    Threshold:
      Errors = 0

    Owner:
      Developer

    Decision:
      PASS / FAIL

QualityRules:
  [QL1]  Static quality checks MUST run before unit tests.
  [QL2]  Quality gate MUST use stack-appropriate tools.
  [QL3]  Quality gate failure blocks subsequent gates.
  [QL4]  Quality gate evidence MUST be stored.

State: +
  